WEBVTT

00:06:58.860 --> 00:07:02.630
mas as cores sempre repercutiam
mais do que o produto em si.

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:06.760
Levei essas teorias para a rua.

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:09.916
"Ultra Sheen".

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:12.880
"Pink Oil Moisturizer".

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:17.056
Se você for de Chicago:
"Harold's Chicken Shack".

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:18.616
(Risos)

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:21.980
"Currency Exchange + Safe Passage".

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:24.540
"Flamin' Red Hots".

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:27.390
"Loose Squares"...

00:07:28.910 --> 00:07:31.170
e "Crown Royal Bag".